  "note": "Lean bounds the norm of the same line integral, pointwise rather than by Cauchy–Schwarz, with constants about 10⁴ times the book's at q = 3, δ = 0. The book's 226.844 covers only |τ| ≤ 10⁵; the full integral is about 226.850, and 6.01 still holds."
